sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Worker as Worker

    User->>User: Re-check selected options before submitting the request
    User->>API: Submit operation request with confirmed runtime parameters
    API->>Worker: Dispatch background execution task
    Worker->>Worker: Reconcile local state, retry budget, and partial progress markers
    Worker-->>API: Return execution summary and completion metadata
    API-->>User: Surface final response for the current operation
